Licence undeclared --- pending GRDC-Manager consultation.

koine has no licence declared yet. A licence will be chosen only after the
required consultation among the interested parties has taken place (see the
project charter, section 5). The package is local-only and not distributed
while this field reads as undeclared. When koine joins its target backend panel
it is expected to align with that project's licence (GPL (>= 3)), but that is
not a declaration --- it is a stated expectation pending the consultation.

Do not redistribute this package, in whole or in part, until a licence has been
declared in DESCRIPTION and this file has been replaced with the licence text.
